摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"MojiDocs 是一款跨平台的 Markdown Wiki 桌面应用，基于 Electron + Vue 3 + SQLite 构建。","id":"gh:1212064220","install_available":false,"language":"Vue","name":"moji-docs","slug":"opqnext/moji-docs","topics":["deepseek-harness","docs","dsh-plugin","wiki"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"MojiDocs 是一款跨平台的 Markdown Wiki 桌面应用，基于 Electron + Vue 3 + SQLite 构建。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"MojiDocs"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Offline-first Markdown Wiki Desktop App"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Git tracks files, SQLite indexes them — your data stays yours"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Features ·\nDownload ·\nQuick Start ·\nTech Stack ·\nDevelopment ·\nLicense"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"MojiDocs is a cross-platform Markdown Wiki desktop app built with **Electron + Vue 3 + SQLite**."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Core philosophy: **`.md` files are the single source of truth**, tracked and synced via Git. SQLite "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"serves purely as a full-text search index and can be rebuilt from files at any time. Your notes are "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"stored as standard Markdown in the local filesystem, fully compatible with Obsidian, Hugo, Hexo, and"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" as standard Markdown in the local filesystem, fully compatible with Obsidian, Hugo, Hexo, and more."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Document Management**\n- Create, edit, delete, move, and pin documents/directories\n- Tree-structure"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d browsing (Recent / All / Tree views)\n- Drag-and-drop `.md` file import"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Markdown Editor**\n- Dual-pane live preview / single-pane / preview-only mode\n- Toolbar: bold, ital"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ic, heading, quote, list, link, image, code block, table\n- Paste-to-upload images (screenshot → Ctrl"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"+V → auto-saved to `assets/`)\n- Multiple Markdown rendering themes (GitHub, Juejin, etc.)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Search & Versioning**\n- SQLite FTS5 full-text search (keyword highlighting + context snippets)\n- G"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"it version history (browse, preview, rollback)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Sync & Export**\n- Scheduled Git sync (pull + push with conflict detection)\n- PDF export / print\n- "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"Offline-first — all operations complete locally"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Customization**\n- Custom theme colors (color picker + hex input)\n- Dashboard (article/directory/ve"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"rsion stats)\n- Trash (soft delete + cascading restore)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Download"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Go to GitHub Releases to download the installer for your platform:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Platform | Format |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| macOS | `.dmg` |\n| Windows | `.exe` |\n| Linux | `.AppImage` / `.deb` |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### macOS Installation Note"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Since the app is not signed with an Apple Developer certificate, macOS may show \"damaged file\" or \"u"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"nverified developer\" warnings. Fix with either method:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Method 1**: Run in Terminal (recommended)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Method 2**: Right-click the app icon → select \"Open\" → click \"Open\" in the dialog"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> This is a macOS Gatekeeper restriction, not an issue with the app itself. Required once after each"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"atekeeper restriction, not an issue with the app itself. Required once after each install or update."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Node.js ≥ 18\n- npm ≥ 9"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Development"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Build"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Tech Stack"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Technology | Version | Purpose |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| Electron | 33 | Cross-platform desktop framework |\n| Vue 3 | 3.5 | Frontend UI framework |\n| elect"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ron-vite | 2.3 | Build tool |\n| better-sqlite3 | 11 | SQLite database (index + FTS5 full-text search"},{"id":"p35s3","text":") |\n| marked | 17 | Markdown rendering |\n| highlight.js | 11 | Code syntax highlighting |\n| simple-g"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"it | 3.27 | Git sync |\n| chokidar | 3.6 | File system watching |\n| electron-builder | 25 | App packa"},{"id":"p35s5","text":".27 | Git sync |\n| chokidar | 3.6 | File system watching |\n| electron-builder | 25 | App packaging |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Project Structure"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Development Guide"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### Hot Reload"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Change | Restart Required? |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| `renderer/` Vue/CSS files | No (HMR hot reload) |\n| `main/` main process code | Yes, re-run `npm r"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"er/` Vue/CSS files | No (HMR hot reload) |\n| `main/` main process code | Yes, re-run `npm run dev` |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### Debugging"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- **Renderer process**: DevTools opens automatically in dev mode, or press `Cmd+Option+I`\n- **Main p"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"rocess**: `console.log()` outputs to terminal, or use `--inspect=9229` with Chrome DevTools"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### Releasing"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"1. Update `version` in `package.json`\n2. `npm run build && npm run package`\n3. Create a Release on G"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"itHub Releases (tag: `v1.x.x`)\n4. Upload installers"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Data Storage"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"User data is stored in a user-selected local directory:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"- Uninstalling or reinstalling the app **does not** affect user data\n- `.moji/` is automatically exc"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"luded via `.gitignore` and won't sync to remote"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"MIT License © 2018-2025 opqnext"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
